mcp-docs-approve-connection = Either way, you'll be sent to yap.town to sign in and approve the connection. Approve it only if you initiated it. To disconnect, remove the connector in the assistant's settings.
mcp-docs-capability-limits = That's the full list. It can't change your course, delete cards, edit your profile, or touch your account settings.
mcp-docs-connect-chatgpt = { $label } Settings → Apps & Connectors, enable Developer mode under Advanced settings, then add the connector URL (requires a paid ChatGPT plan).
